== tunnel main available=false width=200
  Download and upload: — (this hub does not count bytes)
    ✖ DEY-X061  Traffic accounting is not available
      Why:  nft is not installed; deyroute shows connection counts only and never shows unknown traffic as 0 B
      Fix:  install nftables (apt install nftables) on a host whose kernel has nf_tables (not an unprivileged container), check monitoring.enabled in config.yaml, then: systemctl restart deyroute-hub
